<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Low Stock Alert - Nexora Admin</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #F8F6F0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #111111;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #F8F6F0;
      padding: 40px 16px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #EAE6DC;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    }
    .header {
      background-color: #0C1413;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .brand {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .brand-accent {
      color: #F59E0B;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 36px 32px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .badge-alert {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background-color: #FEF3C7;
      color: #92400E;
      border: 1px solid #FCD34D;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .greeting {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0D1B1A;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .product-card {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: #FFFBEB;
      border: 1px solid #FDE68A;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .product-img {
      width: 64px;
      height: 64px;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
      margin-right: 16px;
    }
    .stock-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background-color: #EF4444;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .details-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .details-table td {
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
    }
    .details-table td:first-child {
      color: #6B7280;
      width: 40%;
    }
    .details-table td:last-child {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #111111;
    }
    .button-box {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0 16px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #0F766E;
      color: #FFFFFF !important;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #FAFAF9;
      border-top: 1px solid #EAE6DC;
      padding: 24px 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #9CA3AF;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #0F766E;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1 class="brand">NEXORA<span class="brand-accent">.</span></h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <span class="badge-alert">&#9888; Inventory Telemetry Alert</span>
        <h2 class="greeting">Low Stock Catalog Notification</h2>
        <p>A catalog offering has dropped below the minimum safety threshold (fewer than 10 units remaining). Action is recommended to replenish stock or pause marketing.</p>

        <table class="details-table">
          <tr>
            <td>Product Name</td>
            <td><%= product.name %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Current Inventory</td>
            <td>
              <span class="stock-badge">
                <%= product.stock === 0 ? 'OUT OF STOCK' : product.stock + ' units remaining' %>
              </span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <% if (product.sku) { %>
            <tr>
              <td>SKU / Identifier</td>
              <td style="font-family: monospace;"><%= product.sku %></td>
            </tr>
          <% } %>
          <tr>
            <td>Category</td>
            <td><%= product.category %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Unit Retail Price</td>
            <td>₦<%= Number(product.price || 0).toLocaleString() %></td>
          </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="button-box">
          <a href="<%= adminUrl %>" class="btn">Manage & Restock Product</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        Automated platform notification &bull; Nexora Inventory Controller<br>
        <a href="<%= clientUrl %>/admin/dashboard">Go to Admin Command Console</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
